OL,3,GNEWSAFerry problems may affect Pride
OL,4,Aattendance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are concerns some people
OL,7,Ftravelling from Jersey may have
OL,8,Fdifficulty attending Channel Island's
OL,9,FPride 10th anniversary event in
OL,10,FGuernsey later this month due to a
OL,11,Fferry breaking down.
OL,13,FFerry company Islands Unlimited runs a
OL,14,Fdaily inter-island foot passenger
OL,15,Fservice, and said the MV San Pawl's
OL,16,Fstarboard main engine had a "major
OL,17,Ffailure".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
