OL,3,GNEWSAFerry problems may affect Pride
OL,4,Aattendance
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel Islands Pride is set to
OL,7,Fcelebrate at La Valette Bathing pools
OL,8,Fon 11-13 September - the boat is
OL,9,Fscheduled to be back in operation on 10
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,12,FCEO of Liberate Guernsey Ellie Jones
OL,13,Fsaid: "There isn't much buffer time,
OL,14,Fbut hopefully their guys will work
OL,15,Ftheir magic and it will all be good,
OL,16,Fbut if it's not we will make the best
OL,17,Fof it."
